  description: The storm follows you. Crosses of violet lightning turn about the
    Stormcaller as it hunts, and the thunder always aims.
  tactics: 'Capped red homing bolts plus rotating StormCross volleys. The homing
    bolts give up after a second - bait them wide, then cut back. Tempest (below
    55%) adds a radial ring and speed: the crosses keep rotating, so never park in
    a gap; ride it.'
